CORE
main.cpp

^file main\.cpp line 6: duplicate direct base class 'X'$
^CONVERSION ERROR$
^EXIT=6$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
N5008 [class.mi]/3: "A class shall not be specified as a direct base class of
a derived class more than once" (an indirect one can, see
cpp_repeated_base_member_access).  The front end reported this through the
check for repeated bases ("non-virtual base class tag-X inherited multiple
times"), which is removed.  g++ 13 ("duplicate base type 'X' invalid") and
clang++ 18 ("base class 'X' specified more than once") reject this program.
